WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
[BEEPING]

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.840
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.520
SPEAKER: As our customers
use cloud in bigger ways,

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.020
it's becoming
increasingly important

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.030
to simplify cloud management.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.370
Deployment Manager is an
infrastructure deployment

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.170
service that
automates the creation

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:18.860
and management of Google
Cloud Platform resources.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.350
Write flexible template
and configuration files

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.940
and use them to
create deployments

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:25.770
that have a variety of
Cloud Platform services,

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.950
such as Google Cloud
Storage, Google Compute

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:31.670
Engine, and Google Cloud SQL,
configured to work together.

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.280
This hands-on lab shows you
how to use Deployment Manager

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.710
to create a simple
configuration file,

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.780
use that file to
create a deployment,

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.600
and then view deployment
information on a manifest.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.200
So what you'll do in this lab
is create a configuration,

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.410
deploy the
configuration, inspect

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:50.750
the running environment,
view the deployment manifest.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.090
Deployment Manager allows
you to easily deploy

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:55.070
systems in a
variety of locations

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:57.440
and provides the control
needed to easily roll out

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.800
new services.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.380
It also gives you
the flexibility

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:03.890
to deploy several versions
of your code simultaneously.

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:05.960
Next up on our quest
is Stackdriver--

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:06.980
Qwik Start.

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:09.560
This self-paced lab is a part
of the Deployment Manager

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:12.620
and baseline
infrastructure quests.

